---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout page="about" title="About us | Connectivity Care Solutions" description="Registered NDIS provider in Eleebana, NSW. Meet our founder Susan and learn about our mission, vision and values.">
  <section class="about-top">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <p class="lede">We're a registered NDIS provider in Eleebana, NSW, built on a genuine commitment to making a positive difference in people's lives.</p>
        <h2 class="sub-heading">Our Story</h2>
        <p>Connectivity Care Solutions began in 2022. Our founder, Susan, wanted to offer support that looks after a person's overall wellbeing, not just a list of tasks.</p>
        <p>Hard work, a love for what we do, and the trust of participants, their families and friends are what keep us going.</p>
        <p>We're a registered provider and fully compliant with NDIS regulations and standards, so you can feel confident in the support you receive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-card">
        <img src="/images/Susan.png" alt="Portrait of Susan, founder of Connectivity Care Solutions" width="1080" height="1080">
        <p class="name">Susan<span>Founder, Connectivity Care Solutions</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <svg class="wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 140" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#F01A78" d="M0 140V40c160-42 320-52 520-18s420 66 640 30c100-16 180-34 280-52v140z"/></svg>

  <section class="mission">
    <div class="heart-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 92"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="mission-card">
        <h2><span class="thin">Our</span> Mission</h2>
        <p>We empower people by supporting their independence and connecting them with their community.</p>
        <p>With <strong>Connectivity Care</strong>, you're not alone, and you never have to be. We partner with you so you can live freely in an inclusive community where you're valued and supported.</p>
        <h2><span class="thin">Our</span> Vision</h2>
        <p>A society that sees beyond disability, where people are empowered to build their independence at home and in their community.</p>
        <p>We aim to be one of the leading NDIS registered providers, setting new standards for quality care and innovation.</p>
        <h2><span class="thin">What</span> Guides Us</h2>
        <p>Five values shape every shift, every conversation and every plan.</p>
        <div class="values">
          <details class="value"><summary><svg class="chev"><use href="#i-chevron"/></svg>Respect</summary><div class="body">We listen first and honour each person's choices, background and privacy.</div></details>
          <details class="value"><summary><svg class="chev"><use href="#i-chevron"/></svg>Care and Compassion</summary><div class="body">Support delivered with warmth, patience and genuine kindness.</div></details>
          <details class="value"><summary><svg class="chev"><use href="#i-chevron"/></svg>Integrity</summary><div class="body">We're honest and transparent with participants and their families.</div></details>
          <details class="value"><summary><svg class="chev"><use href="#i-chevron"/></svg>Uplifting Environment</summary><div class="body">We create spaces where people feel encouraged, valued and free to grow.</div></details>
          <details class="value"><summary><svg class="chev"><use href="#i-chevron"/></svg>Qualified Staff</summary><div class="body">Our team brings the right training and experience to every shift.</div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-offered">
    <div class="wrap so-grid">
      <div>
        <h2>See how we can support you</h2>
        <p class="lede">We offer a range of person-centred services because we know one size doesn't fit all.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-white" href="/services">View our services</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="so-photo"><img src="/images/cafe.jpg" alt="A man smiling at an outdoor café table" style="object-position:50% 40%"></figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
